# PQ-003: A competing phosphate pool can remove iron from a coloured complex
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.001mol
add v1 FeCl3 0.0001mol
add v1 KSCN 0.0005mol
new
decant v1 v2 0.5
add v1 H3PO4 0.001mol
add v2 HCl 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
inspect
